+# SC-008 Coverage Map: Phone Number Redaction and Output Folder
+
+**Feature**: `002-phone-redaction-out-dir` | **Date**: 2026-11-14 | **Task**: T046
+
+SC-008 requires every functional requirement and every edge case in [spec.md](./spec.md) to have
+at least one covering test. This map names them. Paths are relative to the repository root;
+`unit/` is `tests/unit/` and `cli/` is `tests/cli/`.
+
+Suite state at the time of writing: **265 passed, 1 skipped** (the skip is the pre-existing
+`001` permission test, which cannot run as root).
+
+---
+
